---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: "/resources/b2b-lead-generation-pricing-report/"
title: "2027 B2B Lead Generation Pricing Report: What 10 Agencies Charge"
seoTitle: "2027 B2B Lead Generation Pricing: 10 Agencies Compared"
description: "See what 10 B2B lead generation agencies charge. Compare starting prices, setup fees, billing terms and what your sales team gets before a meeting."
canonicalUrl: "https://www.callteam.ca/resources/b2b-lead-generation-pricing-report/"
date: "2026-11-17"
modified: "2026-11-17"
contentLanguage: "en-CA"
ogType: "article"
pageStyles: ["/assets/css/lead-providers.css", "/assets/css/simple-buying-guide.css", "/assets/css/decision-guides.css", "/assets/css/process-video-preview.css", "/assets/css/lead-generation-pricing-report.css"]
---
{% set report = leadGenerationPricingReport %}
{% from "components/process-video-preview.njk" import processVideoPreview %}
{% import "components/decision-guide.njk" as guide %}
<script type="application/ld+json">
{"@context":"https://schema.org","@graph":[
  {"@type":"WebPage","@id":"{{ canonicalUrl }}#webpage","url":"{{ canonicalUrl }}","name":{{ title | json | safe }},"description":{{ description | json | safe }},"inLanguage":"en-CA","breadcrumb":{"@id":"{{ canonicalUrl }}#breadcrumb"},"mainEntity":{"@id":"{{ canonicalUrl }}#report"}},
  {"@type":"Article","@id":"{{ canonicalUrl }}#report","headline":{{ title | json | safe }},"description":{{ description | json | safe }},"datePublished":"{{ date | sitemapDate }}","dateModified":"{{ modified }}","mainEntityOfPage":{"@id":"{{ canonicalUrl }}#webpage"},"author":{"@id":"{{ site.organizationId }}"},"publisher":{"@id":"{{ site.organizationId }}"}},
  {"@type":"BreadcrumbList","@id":"{{ canonicalUrl }}#breadcrumb","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"{{ site.url }}/"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"Outbound Sales Library","item":"{{ site.url }}/resources/outbound-sales-library/"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":3,"name":"B2B Lead Generation Pricing Report","item":"{{ canonicalUrl }}"}]},
  {"@type":"ItemList","@id":"{{ canonicalUrl }}#comparison","name":"B2B lead generation agencies with pricing and buying terms","itemListOrder":"https://schema.org/ItemListUnordered","numberOfItems":{{ report.providers | length }},"itemListElement":[{% for provider in report.providers %}{"@type":"ListItem","position":{{ loop.index }},"name":{{ provider.name | json | safe }},"url":"{{ canonicalUrl }}#{{ provider.id }}"}{% if not loop.last %},{% endif %}{% endfor %}]},
  {"@type":"FAQPage","@id":"{{ canonicalUrl }}#questions","mainEntity":[{% for faq in report.faqs %}{"@type":"Question","name":{{ faq.question | json | safe }},"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":{{ faq.answer | json | safe }}}}{% if not loop.last %},{% endif %}{% endfor %}]}
]}
</script>

<main class="lp-page dg-page lpr-page" id="simple-guide">
  <div class="lp-hero-shell"><div class="lp-wrap">
    <nav class="lp-breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><a href="/resources/outbound-sales-library/">Outbound Sales Library</a><span>/</span><span aria-current="page">Lead generation pricing report</span></nav>
    <div class="lp-hero">
      <div>
        <p class="lp-kicker">Agency buying guide</p>
        <h1>2027 B2B Lead Generation Pricing Report</h1>
        <p class="lp-intro">Compare ten agencies on price, fees and contract terms. See what each program buys and what sales receives.</p>
        <div class="lp-actions"><a class="lp-button" href="#comparison">Compare all ten prices ↓</a><a class="lp-text-link" href="/assets/downloads/2027-b2b-lead-generation-agency-prices.csv" download="CallTeam-2027-B2B-Lead-Generation-Pricing.csv">Download the price sheet ↓</a></div>
      </div>
      <aside class="lp-brief lpr-brief" aria-labelledby="lpr-budget">
        <h2 id="lpr-budget">Buy what you need</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Managed calling</strong> for a ready list.</li>
          <li><strong>Dedicated rep</strong> for daily outreach.</li>
          <li><strong>Calls, email and LinkedIn</strong> together.</li>
        </ul>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </div></div>
  <nav class="lp-jump" aria-label="On this page"><div class="lp-wrap">
    <a href="#comparison">Price table</a><a href="#callteam-proof">CallTeam’s work</a><a href="#costs">Worked costs</a><a href="#agency-offers">Agency verdicts</a><a href="#quotes">Compare quotes</a><a href="#questions">FAQs</a>
  </div></nav>

  <section class="lp-section" id="comparison"><div class="lp-wrap">
    <div class="lp-heading">
      <h2>What ten B2B lead generation agencies charge</h2>
      <p>CallTeam publishes this report. We checked public prices on <time datetime="{{ report.checkedDate }}">{{ report.checkedLabel }}</time>. Rates use the currency each provider lists.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="sg-table-wrap">
      <table class="lp-table sg-table dg-table lpr-table" role="table">
        <caption>Published prices, fees and service scope</caption>
        <thead><tr role="row"><th scope="col" role="columnheader">Agency</th><th scope="col" role="columnheader">Price you can verify</th><th scope="col" role="columnheader">Fees and terms</th><th scope="col" role="columnheader">What you buy</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
        {% for provider in report.providers %}
          <tr role="row"{% if loop.first %} class="lpr-callteam-row"{% endif %}>
            <th scope="row" role="rowheader"><a href="#{{ provider.id }}">{{ provider.name }}</a></th>
            <td role="cell" data-label="Price you can verify"><strong>{{ provider.rate }}</strong></td>
            <td role="cell" data-label="Fees and terms">{{ provider.terms }}</td>
            <td role="cell" data-label="What you buy">{{ provider.scope }}</td>
          </tr>
        {% endfor %}
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </div></section>

  <section class="lp-section lp-paper" id="callteam-proof"><div class="lp-wrap">
    <div class="lp-heading">
      <h2>When to choose CallTeam</h2>
      <p>CallTeam calls your target accounts and qualifies buyers before booking them. We also follow up with leads from your email and LinkedIn campaigns.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="lpr-evidence">
      {{ processVideoPreview('See how CallTeam works', 'Watch how we qualify a buyer and prepare your sales rep for the meeting.', 'agency-pricing-report') }}
      <div class="lpr-handoff">
        <h3>What the rep sees in the CRM</h3>
        <p>Sample handoff</p>
        <dl>
          <div><dt>Buyer</dt><dd>Operations director who owns site selection.</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Business reason</dt><dd>Three expansion sites are under review. The team ranks them in spreadsheets.</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Meeting purpose</dt><dd>See how the platform compares two candidate sites.</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Next step</dt><dd>Buyer accepted the demo and will invite the real estate lead.</dd></div>
        </dl>
        <a href="/articles/how-to-hand-off-qualified-appointment-from-sdr-to-sales/">See the full CRM handoff guide →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="sg-two sg-after lpr-case-studies">
      <div><h3>11 qualified SaaS demos in 90 days</h3><p>Four became sales opportunities. Two customers signed within six months.</p><a href="/case-studies/saas-demo-appointment-setting/">Read the SaaS case study →</a></div>
      <div><h3>18 financial services meetings booked in 90 days</h3><p>The campaign reached finance and advisory buyers for outsourced research and analyst support.</p><a href="/case-studies/financial-services-appointment-setting/">Read the financial services case study →</a></div>
    </div>
  </div></section>

  <section class="lp-section" id="costs"><div class="lp-wrap">
    <div class="lp-heading"><h2>How fees and billing terms change the total</h2></div>
    <p>For pricing tied to site walkthroughs and bid opportunities, see the <a href="/resources/best-commercial-contractor-lead-generation-companies/">commercial contractor lead generation comparison</a>.</p>
    <div class="sg-flow lpr-costs">
      <div>
        <h3>Turn four-week billing into a monthly budget</h3>
        <p>SalesRoads’ one-rep rate generates 13 bills over 52 weeks. That’s <strong>{{ report.costs.salesRoadsYear }}</strong> for a full year at the listed rate, or about <strong>{{ report.costs.salesRoadsMonthlyEquivalent }} per calendar month</strong>.</p>
        <p>Compare that dedicated SDR program with managed calling from {{ report.costs.callTeamMonthly }} at CallTeam. Buy dedicated capacity if your campaign needs it.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>Build up the CIENCE bill</h3>
        <p>One offshore rep, the campaign team and the platform start at <strong>{{ report.costs.cienceOffshoreBase }}</strong>. Choosing a US or European rep brings the base to <strong>{{ report.costs.cienceLocalBase }}</strong>.</p>
        <p>Add setup and the performance bonus to get the full bill at your held-meeting target.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>Budget for the pod or the employee</h3>
        <p>One Callbox pod starts <strong>{{ report.costs.callboxDifference }} higher per month</strong> than CallTeam’s entry program. Price it when you need more markets or languages.</p>
        <p>EBQ’s full-time rate comes to <strong>{{ report.costs.ebqFullTimeYear }}</strong> over its published 12-month commitment.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="lpr-section-link">Compare the cost per booked, held and sales-accepted meeting with your own results. <a href="/articles/b2b-appointment-setting-cost/">Use the appointment-setting cost guide →</a></p>
  </div></section>

  <section class="lp-section lp-paper" id="agency-offers"><div class="lp-wrap">
    <div class="lp-heading"><h2>Agency pricing, tradeoffs and verdicts</h2></div>
    <div class="dg-reviews">
    {% for provider in report.providers %}
      <article class="lp-provider lpr-provider" id="{{ provider.id }}">
        <header class="lp-provider-head"><h3>{{ provider.name }} pricing</h3><a class="lp-source" href="{{ provider.sources[0][1] }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Official source ↗</a></header>
        <ul class="lpr-offers" aria-label="{{ provider.name }} fees and plans">
          {% for offer in provider.offers %}
          <li><div class="lpr-offer-rate"><span>{{ offer[0] }}</span><strong>{{ offer[1] }}</strong></div><p><small>{{ offer[2] }}</small> {{ offer[3] }} {{ offer[4] }}</p></li>
          {% endfor %}
        </ul>
        <div class="lp-provider-body">
          <div class="lp-provider-detail"><h4>What you get</h4><p>{{ provider.strength }}</p><h4>Watch the terms</h4><p>{{ provider.tradeoff }}</p></div>
          <aside class="lp-verdict"><h4>CallTeam verdict</h4><p class="lp-verdict-text">{{ provider.verdict }}</p></aside>
        </div>
        {{ guide.sources(provider.sources) }}
      </article>
    {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <p class="dg-related">Still deciding which agencies to invite? <a href="/articles/best-b2b-lead-generation-agencies/">Start with the agency shortlist →</a></p>
  </div></section>

  <section class="lp-section" id="quotes"><div class="lp-wrap">
    <div class="lp-heading"><h2>Put two agency quotes side by side</h2><p>Ask both agencies to price the same target market and scope.</p></div>
    <div class="sg-flow">
      <div><h3>The bill dates</h3><p>Get the setup invoice, recurring fee, minimum term and notice deadline. Ask which charges start before outreach.</p></div>
      <div><h3>The meeting rules</h3><p>Define a good-fit account and buyer. Check when an appointment uses up a slot and who handles reschedules or rejects.</p></div>
      <div><h3>The work your team inherits</h3><p>Check who supplies the data, handles replies and logs the CRM record. Give sales a sample meeting note to review.</p></div>
    </div>
    <div class="lp-actions lpr-quote-actions"><a class="lp-button" href="/lead-generation-proposal-comparison/">Compare your agency proposals →</a><a class="lp-text-link" href="/b2b-meeting-quality-check/">Check your own meeting quality →</a></div>
    <div class="sg-mid-cta"><p><strong>Already have target accounts?</strong> Tell us who you want to reach and what your sales team needs to know before a meeting.</p><a class="lp-button" href="https://calendly.com/hello-callteam/new-meeting" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-booking-placement="lead-generation-pricing-report">Get a CallTeam quote ↗</a></div>
  </div></section>

  <section class="lp-section lp-paper" id="questions"><div class="lp-wrap lp-faq-wrap">
    <div class="lp-heading"><h2>B2B lead generation pricing FAQs</h2></div>
    <div class="lp-faqs">{% for faq in report.faqs %}<details><summary>{{ faq.question }}</summary><p>{{ faq.answer }}</p></details>{% endfor %}</div>
  </div></section>
</main>
